This woman is a powerhouse and has forever made her mark on the entertainment industry.

39
00:01:58.360 --> 00:02:03.400
And Jenna, before we play our interview with Allison, I thought we might want to answer

40
00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:04.400
this fan question.

41
00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:05.260
Okay.

42
00:02:05.540 --> 00:02:07.920
It's from Amelia in Akron, Ohio.

43
00:02:08.940 --> 00:02:14.120
Jenna and Angela, what unique gift does Allison bring to the casting experience compared to

44
00:02:14.120 --> 00:02:16.100
other casting directors you've worked with?

45
00:02:16.740 --> 00:02:18.440
Oh, that's a great question.

46
00:02:18.440 --> 00:02:26.570
I mean, I think when you listen to our interview with her, you are going to hear what a thoughtful

47
00:02:26.570 --> 00:02:29.770
and engaging person she is.

48
00:02:30.610 --> 00:02:37.970
And for me, going in to meet with her was very different from meeting with other casting directors.

49
00:02:38.450 --> 00:02:41.610
She has a real curiosity about people.

50
00:02:41.610 --> 00:02:49.670
And I felt like she was very interested in getting to know me as a person as well as me as a performer.

51
00:02:50.610 --> 00:02:52.070
That's exactly it.

52
00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:58.850
When I walked into her office, I was nervous, but she was instantly so calming to me.

53
00:02:59.170 --> 00:03:01.650
And I felt like she was working with me.

54
00:03:01.790 --> 00:03:02.690
That's how I felt.

55
00:03:03.010 --> 00:03:06.210
She wanted me to do the best performance I could.

56
00:03:06.210 --> 00:03:08.030
And I really felt that from her.

57
00:03:08.570 --> 00:03:14.570
Well, we asked you guys to send in your questions for Allison, and you sent in so many fantastic

58
00:03:14.570 --> 00:03:15.310
questions.

59
00:03:15.530 --> 00:03:18.110
And we tried to ask her as many as we could.

60
00:03:18.450 --> 00:03:21.770
This is such a fantastic interview with an amazing woman.

