I'm glad to be here.

75
00:04:14.460 --> 00:04:20.840
Not just Allison in the studio, but three bins of stuff that you brought from your storage

76
00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:21.580
facility.

77
00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:21.940
Yep.

78
